      "content": "Illuminated  if  the  alarm  lamp  is  on  by  the  occurence  of  each  alarm  or  stop  of  the programs(M00, M01, M02, M30). If the alarm lamp is on, the machine stops temporarily and displays the text of alarm on the screen."
